<title>USA: El Salvador seeks 2,000-3,000 T U.S. tallow.</title>
<headline>El Salvador seeks 2,000-3,000 T U.S. tallow.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>El Salvador was tendering for about 2,000 to 3,000 tonnes of U.S. tallow in bulk under the PL-480 Title I export program, its shipping agent, International Services Corp.</p>
<p>Shipment was set for April 21-May 6. Offers are to be received no later than April 14 and all offers must remain valid through April 15, the agent said.</p>
<p>((Doris Frankel 312-983-7305))</p>
</text>
